Restaurant Menu API & Data Extraction Research

1. Executive Summary

This research examines the feasibility, methodologies, and internal mechanisms for programmatically extracting restaurant menu data from leading Israeli and international hospitality and delivery platforms: Wolt, 10bis (תן ביס), Tabit (טאביט), and Ontopo (אונטופו).

While none of these platforms offer an officially documented public developer API for third-party menu ingestion, their client-facing web and mobile applications rely heavily on internal RESTful APIs. Because restaurant menus are inherently consumer-facing data, several platforms expose these endpoints with minimal to zero authentication barriers.
